<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n98897" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφημι</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-φήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					357b
				</span></i>
			, al.: aor. 1
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέφησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					342e
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Sph.</u>
				236d
			</span></i>, al.: aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέφην</span> freq. in <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i> (v. infr.), Elean 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέφα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Schwyzer</u>
					416.5
				</span></i>
			:—<i>assent, approve</i>, or <i>agree fully</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				40
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1310
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύμφημι κἀγώ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					1257
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξ. δή σοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					278
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				266
			</span></i> (anap.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				72d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			rei, <i>concede, agree to, grant</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα . . πάντες ἄρα συνέφασαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					177e
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Sph.</u>
				247a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Prt.</u>
				330d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.8.8
			</span></i>, etc.: hence abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφημί
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοι</span>) <i>I grant</i> you,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				403c
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				608b
			</span></i>; freq. in Platonic dialogue, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύμφαθι
				ἢ ἄπειπε</span>
			<i>say yes</i> or no, ib.<i><span class="en">
				523a
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Grg.</u>
				500e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνέφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					102d
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. acc. et
				inf., <i>agree</i> that . . , <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				553
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				831b
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τῷ νόμῳ ὅτι καλός,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. τὸν νόμον καλὸν
				εἶναι</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Rom.</u>
				7.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> c. inf.
			fut., <i>promise</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.5
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
